  ('2f162c1a-4861-564e-ab0b-1080eaec389d'::uuid, 'kadokawa-culture-museum', 'mixed-use', false, 1.000, 'https://kkaa.co.jp/en/project/tokorozawa-sakura-town-kadokawa-culture-museum/', 'KKAA records October 2020 completion in Saitama and classifies the project as Gallery/Museum/Cultural. KADOKAWA records Kengo Kuma and Associates as design supervisor and Kajima as design-build contractor; the canonical architect relation therefore uses Kengo Kuma while the collaboration remains in the graduation profile.', '2026-07-12T00:00:00Z'::timestamptz),
